{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "meridian/director-interrupts",
  "title": "director.interrupts/1",
  "description": "data/director/interrupts.json: control-scheme step 3 (ADR 0008; control-rules.md sections 1, 2 and 6): the costs, cooldowns and windows of what a fighter does inside an exchange, read by sim/director/interrupt.gd (DirInterrupt). Ticks are sim ticks (60 a second); ki is out of 100. Version field: schema. Policy: closed except keys starting with an underscore; every key required except the window classes (a class not listed has no window). Orders (a walk's minTicks at most its maxTicks; the split's width and power shares at most 1, a warning; kiPatient at most ki; the stale maximums are at least one repeat's step; a one-armed blocker keeps a window; light at most heavy; a window not longer than its wind-up, a warning) are checked by tools/lib/xref-fight.js (interrupts-*).",
